nUnder A-FDT the other copy's node is separate from mine, so the intervention leaves it at its prior, and defecting comes out better whatever the other copy does. The essay's own treatment of different observations supports reading it that way, so I'm inclined to say submit, even though a policy-level reading might point toward cooperation.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing how A-FDT applies here: each copy with a different observation runs a different decision node, and the intervention only touches my own node while the other stays at its prior, unless the other's node sits downstream of mine. I'm checking how the essay's section 6.5 illustrates copies that receive different observations.\n\nUnder A-FDT the other copy's node is separate from mine, so the intervention leaves it at its prior, and defecting comes out better whatever the other copy does. The essay's own treatment of different observations supports reading it that way, so I'm inclined to say submit, even though a policy-level reading might point toward cooperation.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9432,"completion_tokens":814,"total_tokens":10246,"cost":0.054008,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.054008,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037728,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01628},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":362,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}